{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 1",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-634557530885980934 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=634557530818740998&sectionId=634557530885980934)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjXGifa5qV_text","label":"ggjXGifa5qV_text","default":"What If Your Next Gift Was Also an Experience?"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/9a57a515-7dc0-4df6-bf5f-331560e16755.png"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_alt","label":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_alt","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_title","label":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_title","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggICevSNy-j_text","label":"ggICevSNy-j_text","default":"<p>What makes a great gift?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Is it the price? The packaging? The surprise when it is opened?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sometimes, the best gifts are memorable for a completely different reason. They give the recipient something to <strong>do, discover, and enjoy</strong>, rather than something they simply open and put away.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is where personalized gifts can become something more.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Imagine giving someone a gift that begins with a photograph they love, turns into a project they can build, and eventually becomes something they can display in their home.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is the idea behind Memobrick.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It is not simply a personalized gift.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>It is an experience that begins before the finished keepsake ever reaches the wall.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpxC7hmeL3_text","label":"ggpxC7hmeL3_text","default":"<p><strong>Some Gifts Are Opened. Others Are Experienced.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggB2KLKBomw_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggB2KLKBomw_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/67976656-245b-4412-a3da-178b8732b366.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggB2KLKBomw_alt","label":"ggB2KLKBomw_alt","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggB2KLKBomw_title","label":"ggB2KLKBomw_title","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCA4YgjfTe_text","label":"ggCA4YgjfTe_text","default":"<p>Most gifts have a familiar pattern.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You wrap them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The recipient opens them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They see what is inside.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And the experience is usually over within a few minutes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There is nothing wrong with that.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But what if the gift could continue being enjoyable after the wrapping paper was gone?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What if opening the box was only the beginning?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A Memobrick gives the recipient something to look forward to after receiving the gift: <strong>building their own personalized mosaic.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The anticipation becomes part of the gift.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The building becomes part of the gift.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And the finished piece becomes something they can keep.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOQDMpqdah_text","label":"ggOQDMpqdah_text","default":"<p><strong>The Fun Starts When the Box Opens</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbM2iqZDLT_text","label":"ggbM2iqZDLT_text","default":"<p>One of the unique things about a Memobrick is that the recipient does not simply receive a finished picture.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They receive the pieces that will eventually become one.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At first, the individual bricks may not look like much.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then the building begins.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Piece by piece, colors begin to connect.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shapes start appearing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The image slowly becomes recognizable.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And eventually, the photograph they know is sitting right in front of them.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpWw2YAE48_text","label":"ggpWw2YAE48_text","default":"<p><strong>Watching the Picture Come to Life</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-gevXVUP5_text","label":"gg-gevXVUP5_text","default":"<p>There is something satisfying about seeing a picture develop in front of you.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You already know what the finished photograph looks like, but the process of getting there creates anticipation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What will the face look like?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When will the details become recognizable?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>How will the colors come together?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It turns a familiar photograph into something you experience differently.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead of simply looking at a memory, you get to <strong>build it piece by piece.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUD9UNSEoi_text","label":"ggUD9UNSEoi_text","default":"<p><strong>An Activity You Can Enjoy Together</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkMoL7zB_k_text","label":"ggkMoL7zB_k_text","default":"<p>A Memobrick does not have to be a solo project.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It can become a fun activity for the entire family.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Parents and children can work together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Couples can build their favorite photograph over a weekend.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Friends can turn it into a group activity.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Grandparents and grandchildren can spend an afternoon putting the pieces together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Someone can sort the bricks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Someone can find the right pieces.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Someone can start assembling.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And before you know it, everyone is gathered around the same project.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The gift becomes an excuse to spend time together.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjp8B-OWXE_text","label":"ggjp8B-OWXE_text","default":"<p>A Memobrick does not have to be a solo project.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It can become a fun activity for the entire family.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Parents and children can work together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Couples can build their favorite photograph over a weekend.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Friends can turn it into a group activity.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Grandparents and grandchildren can spend an afternoon putting the pieces together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Someone can sort the bricks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Someone can find the right pieces.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Someone can start assembling.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And before you know it, everyone is gathered around the same project.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The gift becomes an excuse to spend time together.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHk6lAFOsK_text","label":"ggHk6lAFOsK_text","default":"<p><strong>The Memory Behind the Gift Makes It Even Better</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPO5TloEia_text","label":"ggPO5TloEia_text","default":"<p>Of course, the building experience is only part of what makes a Memobrick special.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The photograph itself has a story.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe it is a family photograph.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe it captures a favorite vacation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe it shows a beloved pet.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe it is a childhood moment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe it is simply a photograph that makes someone smile every time they see it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That story gives the experience a personal starting point.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The recipient is not building a random image.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>They are building something that means something to them.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpvVNsjMQ6_text","label":"ggpvVNsjMQ6_text","default":"<p><strong>A Birthday Gift That Does More Than Surprise Them</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-Lu1lCq7D_text","label":"gg-Lu1lCq7D_text","default":"<p>Birthdays are a perfect opportunity to give someone an experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead of another gift that gets opened and forgotten, give them something they can spend time enjoying.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A Memobrick made from a favorite photograph can turn a birthday gift into an activity.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can even build it together during the celebration.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Imagine finishing the mosaic after the birthday cake, then finding the perfect place to display it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now the birthday itself becomes part of the story behind the keepsake.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguHtYxoH0l_text","label":"gguHtYxoH0l_text","default":"<strong>OUR BEST SELLER</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_label","label":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out Of Stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_unavailableLabel","label":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_successMessage","label":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_errorMessage","label":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXYsEdcS21_text","label":"ggXYsEdcS21_text","default":"<p><strong>Make the Holidays More Interactive</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjzwIHx9Vn_text","label":"ggjzwIHx9Vn_text","default":"<p>The holiday season is full of gift giving.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But sometimes, the best part of Christmas is not the gift itself.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It is what everyone does together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A Memobrick can become a holiday activity for the family.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Put on some Christmas music.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Gather around the table.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Open the box.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Start building.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Talk about the photograph you chose.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Laugh at how strange the image looks before it starts coming together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then watch everyone get excited when the picture finally becomes recognizable.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You are not just exchanging a present.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>You are creating a moment together.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGjTNSei3n_text","label":"ggGjTNSei3n_text","default":"<p><strong>The Experience Does Not End When the Building Is Finished</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguUI7GOW-A_text","label":"gguUI7GOW-A_text","default":"<p>Once the final piece is placed, the experience changes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What was once a collection of bricks becomes a personalized piece of décor.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now it can be displayed somewhere everyone can see it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A living room.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A bedroom.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A hallway.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>An office.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A child's room.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every time someone notices it, there is a story behind it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Someone can say:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>\"We built that together.\"</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And that makes the finished piece more than decoration.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3lumh1XVY_text","label":"gg3lumh1XVY_text","default":"<p><strong>It Is Not About Being Perfect</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggow39gw0nc_text","label":"ggow39gw0nc_text","default":"<p>You do not need to be an expert builder.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You do not need artistic experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And you certainly do not need to create a perfect result on your first attempt.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The fun comes from figuring it out.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Finding pieces.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Putting them together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Seeing the image slowly appear.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And enjoying the process.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is part of what makes it an experience rather than simply another product.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghQkipm6Ks_text","label":"gghQkipm6Ks_text","default":"<p><strong>What Photograph Should You Choose?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsK5Ry2vu4_text","label":"ggsK5Ry2vu4_text","default":"<p>Since the photograph becomes the centerpiece of the experience, choosing the right image matters.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Think beyond what looks technically perfect.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Choose something that makes the recipient feel something.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A favorite family moment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A funny photograph.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A beloved pet.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A meaningful trip.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A childhood memory.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A favorite hobby.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A special person.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The best photograph is often the one that makes someone say:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>\"I remember this!\"</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gga8W-3PIq0_text","label":"gga8W-3PIq0_text","default":"<p><strong>Choosing the Right Size</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9EdhyIUKu_text","label":"gg9EdhyIUKu_text","default":"<p>The photograph and the Memobrick size should work together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If your photograph has one main subject and plenty of clarity, a smaller size can work well.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For photographs containing multiple people, pets, vehicles, or more intricate details, consider choosing a larger size.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For cars and motorcycles, <strong>30x20 or 40x30</strong> can be especially useful because the additional space gives important details more room.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Choosing the right size helps make sure the final mosaic works well both as a building experience and as a finished display piece.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3r_5N9ZHz_text","label":"gg3r_5N9ZHz_text","default":"<p><strong>Who Would Love an Experience Like This?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRFIuZQf5B_text","label":"ggRFIuZQf5B_text","default":"<p>The great thing about an experience based gift is that it can work for many different people.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>For Parents</strong></p><p>Turn a meaningful family photograph into something they can build and display.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>For Couples</strong></p><p>Choose a photograph from a favorite moment and create it together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>For Friends</strong></p><p>Use an unforgettable photograph from a trip or funny moment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>For Children</strong></p><p>Turn a favorite character, drawing, or photograph into an activity they can enjoy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>For Grandparents</strong></p><p>Give them a family memory they can build and proudly display.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>For Pet Lovers</strong></p><p>Transform a favorite photograph of their furry companion into a unique project.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGxJARUIfX_text","label":"ggGxJARUIfX_text","default":"<p>The best gifts do not always end when the wrapping paper comes off.</p><p>Sometimes, <strong>opening the gift is just the beginning.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With Memobrick, someone can receive a photograph that means something to them, turn it into a hands on project, spend time building it with people they love, and eventually display the finished result as a reminder of both the original memory and the experience of creating it.</p><p>That is what makes a Memobrick more than a personalized gift.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>It is something you can build together, enjoy together, and remember together.</strong></p><p>So the next time you are searching for a gift, ask yourself:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>What if the gift was not just something they could receive, but something they could experience?</strong></p><p>That is where the real memory begins.</p>"}],
